  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Is there a minimum order value for free pickup?",
      "a": "We keep the minimum low and flexible. Send us a WhatsApp with your address and we will confirm the minimum for your area — on a first order we can usually waive it."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do your prices include GST?",
      "a": "No — every price on this page is a base rate and GST is added at 18% as per government norms. It is shown separately in your cart, so there are no surprises at the end."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why is dry cleaning priced per item but laundry priced per kilo?",
      "a": "Laundry is bulk work, so weighing by the kilo is fairer for a family load. Dry cleaning needs individual inspection, stain treatment and handling per garment, so per-item pricing means you only pay for the pieces that need expert care."
    },
    {
      "q": "How much does dry cleaning a lehenga or wedding outfit cost?",
      "a": "Our lehenga rate starts at ₹399. Heavy, bridal and beadwork pieces are quoted after inspection, because the price depends on weight, embroidery and fabric. Send a photo on WhatsApp and we will give you an accurate figure before you commit."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are your rates competitive?",
      "a": "We own our processing facility rather than running as a franchise, and our machinery is water- and power-efficient, so our rates sit below most app-based services while pickup and delivery stay free."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer corporate or bulk pricing?",
      "a": "Yes. We provide customised commercial rates for hotels, salons, gyms, corporate offices and housing societies. Email care@wash4you.in or call us for a tailored quote."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I get same-day or express service?",
      "a": "Express processing is available at 1.5× the standard rate. Same-day delivery depends on your area and the size of the order — call to confirm availability before you book."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if I am not happy with the result?",
      "a": "Tell us and we will reprocess the order at no additional cost. We would rather redo a piece than have you live with it."
    }
